      "writtenOn": "2021-08-19T17:16:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This macro is an anti-pattern. It\u0027s very rare a feature will only apply to one specific version, so it should be extremely hard to do that.\n\nI.e., I would rather people have to write it out the long way, just because the pattern should be so uncommon.",
      "parentUuid": "83428350_62fa52a2",
      "revId": "9bbfd5fef40d18795ae9e57fc2741077fb5c1eaa",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
